message: "If you use V-Rush, please cite the software and the specific archived release."
title: "V-Rush: An Interactive Computer-Vision Workbench"
abstract: >-
  V-Rush is an interactive browser-based workbench for building, inspecting, and
  exporting computer-vision pipelines. It combines classical OpenCV operations,
  ONNX-based detection and segmentation, local-feature matching, image statistics,
  and reproducible code export.
